# React Component Conventions

## FSD Component Layers

| Layer | Path | Naming | Purpose |
|-------|------|--------|---------|
| shared/ui | `shared/ui/<name>.tsx` | kebab-case | Primitives: Avatar, Badge, Button, Icon, ScrollArea |
| widgets | `widgets/<name>/<name>.ui.tsx` | kebab-case | Composites: layout, sidebar, message-list, top-bar |
| features | `features/<name>/<name>.ui.tsx` | kebab-case | Scenarios: ai-reply, sticker-picker, instance-switch |
| pages | `pages/<name>/<name>.ui.tsx` | kebab-case | Routes: chat, activity, login (lazy-loaded) |

## Component Structure

```tsx
import React, { useState, useEffect, useCallback } from "react";
import type { SomeType } from "~/entities/some/some.types";
import { useSomeStore } from "~/entities/some";
import { Icon } from "~/shared/ui";

interface MyComponentProps {
  title: string;
  onAction?: () => void;
}

export const MyComponent: React.FC<MyComponentProps> = ({ title, onAction }) => {
  const data = useSomeStore((s) => s.data);
  const [localState, setLocalState] = useState(false);

  useEffect(() => { /* ... */ }, []);

  const handleClick = useCallback(() => {
    onAction?.();
  }, [onAction]);

  return <div className="...">{title}</div>;
};
```

## Rules

- `React.FC<Props>` for component typing
- Props interface next to the component, `Props` suffix
- Zustand selectors — minimal, subscribe to specific fields: `useStore((s) => s.field)`
- Event handlers: `handleXxx` naming convention
- Conditional rendering: `{condition && <Component />}`, not ternaries for JSX blocks
- Cleanup in useEffect — always return cleanup function for subscriptions
- Import stores from concrete files: `from "~/entities/user/user.model"` (no barrel `index.ts`)
- Import shared UI from concrete files: `from "~/shared/ui/icon"`, `from "~/shared/ui/button"`, etc.

## Layout

- Use Tailwind flexbox/grid, not CSS modules
- Responsive: desktop-first, `min-h-0 min-w-0` for flex-children
- Spacing via Tailwind tokens, not magic numbers
- Colors — only semantic tokens (`bg-card-bg`, `text-text-primary`, `accent`), not hex values
